obs the QA frame on tools/f/fleet_watch.sh closed with a measurement rather than a molt, which is what the water row teaches about frames. It reads C+ (composite 76) -- and it read exactly 76 before my comment landed, graded off git show HEAD:. The whole deficit is Register at 32, from 68% negative sentences in a file whose subject IS refusal, and Gauge's own law uncaps negation at Meter. That is the instrument question already booked on the card, rather than a fault in the page, so the frame does not push a rewrite.
